# Mario & Luigi: Superstar Saga (USA, Australia): title screen, the castle's opening scenes, then the player walks a Toad around a house in Toad Town (gate G9, route depth).
# Start and A taps every 30 frames from frame 300 to 5,800 (title, file, the castle scenes), Down at 6,100, Right at 6,250: the room scrolls and the character moves.
# The scene waits for the player from about frame 6,000 (a Toad inside a house); the frame limit is 6,500. For the delivered player with no save.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
